xtras/999ef9699d5a07a9d7277311258caaf4.mp4?t=1745194041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PARKOUR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump and Sprint to explore your way out of the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229290/extras/dbbafaac190ccbe582a75c2987e17063.poster.avif?t=1745194041\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229290/extras/dbbafaac190ccbe582a75c2987e17063.webm?t=1745194041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229290/extras/dbbafaac190ccbe582a75c2987e17063.mp4?t=1745194041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Est 45 - 60 minutes   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROADMAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will try to fix any bugs that occur</p>",
