        "notes": "Rusted contains psychological horror themes, including graphic depictions of gore and violence and suicide.\r\n\r\n The game features sudden loud noises and jump scares. There are scenes that may be disturbing or triggering, involving mental health struggles, hallucinations, and emotional trauma.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, the game explores themes related to death, isolation, and despair, which may be unsettling for some players. \r\n\r\nPlayers should use discretion if they are sensitive to topics such as suicide, or psychological trauma."
